sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant GW as Gateway<br/>80/TCP HTTP
    participant EPP as EPP (ext_proc)<br/>9002/TCP gRPC
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy<br/>8081/TCP HTTP
    participant Decode as Decode vLLM Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Prefill as Prefill vLLM Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>4317/TCP gRPC

    Note over Client,Decode: Inference Request Flow (Standard)
    Client->>GW: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTP/80
    GW->>EPP: ext_proc request<br/>gRPC/9002
    Note right of EPP: Scoring plugins evaluate:<br/>- queue depth<br/>- KV cache utilization<br/>- prefix cache hits<br/>- LRU eviction
    EPP-->>GW: Selected endpoint<br/>x-gateway-destination-endpoint header
    GW->>Envoy: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8081
    Envoy->>Decode: ORIGINAL_DST routing<br/>HTTP/8000
    Decode-->>Envoy: Completion response
    Envoy-->>GW: Response
    GW-->>Client: JSON response

    EPP->>OTel: Export traces<br/>gRPC/4317<br/>parentbased_traceidratio sampling

    Note over Client,Decode: P/D Disaggregation Flow
    Client->>GW: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTP/80
    GW->>EPP: ext_proc request<br/>gRPC/9002
    EPP-->>GW: Route to prefill worker
    GW->>Envoy: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8081
    Envoy->>Prefill: Prompt processing<br/>HTTP/8000
    Note right of Prefill: Process prompt tokens<br/>Generate KV cache
    Prefill->>Decode: KV cache transfer<br/>nixl TCP/5600
    Decode-->>Envoy: Token generation<br/>from transferred cache
    Envoy-->>GW: Streaming response
    GW-->>Client: Completion tokens

    Note over Client,Decode: Health Check Flow
    Client->>Decode: GET /health<br/>HTTP/8000
    Decode-->>Client: 200 OK

    Client->>Decode: GET /v1/models<br/>HTTP/8000
    Decode-->>Client: Model list
